<h3>Teaching and curriculum</h3>
<p>Designed and taught <mark class="cv-highlight">30 courses and workshops</mark> (2013–2022), primarily at <a href="https://srishtimanipalinstitute.in/">Srishti Manipal Institute</a> in Bangalore, connecting interaction design and human-computer interaction with creative coding, algorithmic botany, physical computing and machine learning.</p>

<p>Designed and facilitated <a href="/notes/deconstructing-algorithms/">Deconstructing Algorithms: a thesis studio on algorithmic literacy</a> in 2020. Supervised five undergraduate students investigating explainable AI and impact-investment information.</p>

